<Panels>
  <config><![CDATA[{
  "game_id": 73,
  "created_at": "2026-05-19T22:23:06.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 1,
  "properties": {
    "panels": [
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-content-elements-review-a8441943-bac9-49d3-aff3-5f44b4c55dce",
        "text": "We started this lesson by exploring how to build **meaningful content** using HTML tags. These tags are like special instructions for the browser!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/f894545e4f59faaed31545bf8cf1d5b2-test-lesson-content-elements-review-panel-1-748fe3da-6aa4-4563-8830-35e9e13d6bdb.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-content-elements-review-1dfed7ae-07e6-47cc-9b45-55d944f371b1",
        "text": "We learned to structure our pages with **headings** (`<h1>` to `<h6>`) for titles and **paragraphs** (`<p>`) for blocks of text. These give our content a clear hierarchy.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/6d219045da7289986e703ac068d20b36-test-lesson-content-elements-review-panel-2-1841967e-5852-4fe4-ba22-ac9013e8f969.png",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-content-elements-review-0eafe283-427c-4883-ad95-8435fbcf78e0",
        "text": "Then, we discovered **lists**! `<ul>` and `<li>` help us create bulleted items, while `<ol>` and `<li>` are perfect for numbered steps or sequences.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/e7c0d0d96cb6a633a8080048be55f0e4-test-lesson-content-elements-review-panel-3-fdba0fd5-5674-4ed0-ad00-45109edcae98.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-content-elements-review-316c484f-e94f-40f7-85a8-64604178694b",
        "text": "Finally, we learned about **hyperlinks** using the `<a>` tag and `href` attribute. These are like digital bridges, connecting different parts of your site or leading to other websites!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/8f18d839f3163600308e310b6b0bfddd-test-lesson-content-elements-review-panel-4-e67cfeba-a246-4aeb-beb2-da7a7fc91ce7.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-content-elements-review-492dcac3-4a0b-4be5-abf5-c7853a0daf79",
        "text": "By mastering headings, paragraphs, lists, and links, you've gained essential tools to build clear, organized, and navigable web pages. Keep exploring what you can create!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/3121b1639fbf81badee0186ff2aa3899-test-lesson-content-elements-review-panel-5-1d128e02-c1f1-4d20-a0fa-8aaa1a0fc25a.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      }
    ],
    "generate_outline": "Summarize the key HTML content elements learned in the lesson: headings, paragraphs, lists, and hyperlinks. Encourage students to reflect on how these elements help create well-structured and navigable web content."
  },
